# Debug guard: when set, every module/tool that reaches out to a target
# (nmap, whatweb, nikto, sqlmap, the crawler's own HTTP requests) refuses to
# touch anything outside this host, so a debug run can't wander off scope.
# Comment out the line below to disable the restriction (no scope limit):
